engine/assets/ contains sprite images and system sounds derived from maimai, a
product of SEGA. They are included because the engine requires them as build
inputs — `engine/src/systems/audio.rs` embeds the WAVs at compile time, and
`scripts/build-wasm.sh` copies the sprites into the web bundle. No ownership is
claimed over them and no licence is asserted; SEGA retains all rights. maiscope is
an unofficial, non-commercial tool and is not affiliated with or endorsed by SEGA.
On request from a rights holder these assets will be removed and replaced.

(`engine/assets/songs/` — sample chart and audio data — is deliberately NOT in the
repository.)

